  "notes": "{決心|けっしん} is a personal, emotional determination to do something. It emphasizes the moment of making up one's mind.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {決心|けっしん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to make up one's mind\n- {決心|けっしん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦つく→付く：01960_tsuku⟧: to reach a decision\n- {決心|けっしん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{揺|ゆ}らぐ→揺らぐ：07601_yuragu⟧: one's resolve wavers\n- ⟦{固|かた}い→固い：12090_katai⟧{決心|けっしん}: firm resolution\n- {決心|けっしん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{変|か}える→変える：01089_kaeru⟧: to change one's mind\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {決心|けっしん}: personal determination (emotional, individual)\n- ⟦{決意|けつい}→決意：07167_ketsui⟧: resolve (more formal, often public)\n- ⟦{覚悟|かくご}→覚悟：02551_kakugo⟧: preparedness, readiness (implies accepting consequences)\n- ⟦{決断|けつだん}→決断：13250_ketsudan⟧: decision (emphasizes the act of choosing)\n\nFORMS:\n{決|けつ} (decide) + {心|しん} (heart/mind). Literally \"decided heart,\" reflecting the personal nature of this word.",
